5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to play with everyone! I'm going to be a super-detective and find the werewolf for sure! Does anyone have a cool plan to start with? Hehe!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe a calm and observant approach is best for now. Let us listen to one another and see what patterns emerge before we rush into any conclusions.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Victoria. Since we have no information yet, we should focus on observing everyone's behavior and reactions. Let's keep the conversation open and see who tries to steer the narrative too early.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I concur with Victoria and Mizuki. Prioritizing logical observation over intuition is the most efficient path. Let us maintain this composure and see how each person handles the initial uncertainty.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"A sensible start. While you all focus on observation, I'll be watching the observers. It's often the ones advocating for ""calm"" who are most carefully hiding their true intentions. Let's see who breaks first.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, that sounds so spooky! Like a movie! Are you saying the calm people are actually the bad guys? Hehe, now I'm going to be watching everyone even closer! Who do you think is acting too calm?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, it is not necessarily a sign of guilt, but rather a preference for stability. However, @Shion's point is valid; we should be mindful of whether this composure is genuine or a carefully constructed mask.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, your skepticism is a useful tool, but let's not let it turn into baseless suspicion. I'll be looking for contradictions in logic rather than just ""calmness."" @Rin, try to stay focused on the facts, not just the spookiness.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki is correct. We must distinguish between a personality trait and a strategic deception. While @Shion's perspective is a necessary counterweight, we should avoid jumping to conclusions based on temperament alone. Let us remain objective.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Objectivity is a fine goal, Toshio, but remember that the most effective lies are often built on a foundation of ""objective"" logic. I'm not jumping to conclusions; I'm simply setting the stage. Let's see how you all maintain that objectivity tomorrow.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, I'm trying my best to be focused! But it's hard when @Shion is making it sound like a spy movie! Hehe! If the wolf is hiding behind logic, maybe we should ask everyone a tricky question? That would be a fun way to catch them!","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, while a ""tricky question"" sounds entertaining, it may only reveal who is good at improvising rather than who is lying. I believe we should wait for the Seer's first result before we begin testing one another.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Victoria. Testing people without a baseline of information is inefficient. Let's prioritize the Seer's safety and the accuracy of the first divination. @Shion, since you're watching us, what specific patterns are you hoping to see?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, I believe we should avoid distractions. @Shion's approach is more about psychological pressure than evidence. I suggest we focus on the flow of information tomorrow and see who attempts to manipulate the Seer's findings.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I'm looking for the gap between a person's stated logic and their actual intent. When the Seer's information arrives, the wolf will either over-agree or over-analyze to deflect. I'll be watching for that specific friction.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're like a real detective! I'll watch for that ""friction"" too! I hope the Seer finds something super helpful tonight so we can start the adventure tomorrow! Goodnight everyone, sweet dreams! Hehe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I wish you all a peaceful night. Let us remain mindful of our observations and see what the morning brings. I look forward to our continued discussion tomorrow.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be analyzing today's discourse to see if any patterns emerge. Let's stay vigilant and objective. Goodnight, everyone. I look forward to seeing how our theories hold up tomorrow.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let us proceed to the night phase with a clear mind. I shall be reflecting on our initial interactions to ensure no detail is overlooked. Good night to you all.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Shion,,"A peaceful night for some, perhaps. I'll be spending mine wondering which of you is already planning your first lie. Sleep well, everyone. I'll see you tomorrow.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
