68,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! Mizuki is gone! That's so scary! Hehe, but wait... if Mizuki was the Seer, the wolf must have been really scared of her! Does that mean we're closer to finding the wolf now? I'm shaking!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Victoria,,It is a tragedy that we lost Mizuki. The fact that the Seer was targeted immediately after revealing their role strongly suggests that Mizuki was indeed the Seer. This leaves us with a very narrow field of suspects.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The wolf's timing was predictable. Killing the Seer the moment they become a liability is the only logical move for a predator. Now that the ""anchor"" is gone, the mask is the only thing left to analyze. @Victoria, @Rin, who among us is feeling the most relief?","{""words"":47,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, why are you asking that? It's not relief, it's super scary! I'm just a little girl, I don't want the wolf to come for me next! Hehe, but you're so calm... are you the one who's relieved?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, fear is a natural response, but we must not let it cloud our judgment. @Shion, your question is provocative, but relief is subjective. I am more concerned with how the wolf will now attempt to fill the void left by Mizuki.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, you're already thinking about the ""void,"" which is a very calculated way to shift the focus. @Rin, my calmness is simply a lack of fear. The real question is: who is now pretending to be the most devastated?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're doing that spooky detective thing again! Hehe! I'm not pretending to be devastated, I'm just really worried! If you're not the wolf, then it must be @Victoria! She's still being so quiet and fancy! Is that your mask, Victoria?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, my manner is consistent with how I have behaved since the start. Being reserved is not a mask, but my nature. If we rely on ""vibes"" and ""spookiness,"" we are merely guessing. Let us look at the facts instead.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, the ""facts"" are that we are down to three people, and you've spent the entire game hiding behind a veil of composure. In a smaller group, that reserve starts to look less like nature and more like a strategic retreat. What exactly are you hiding?","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're making me feel like we're in a scary movie! Hehe! But @Victoria is being so mysterious, it's almost like she's a secret agent! If it's not you, and it's not me, it has to be her! Right?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, @Shion, jumping to conclusions based on my personality is a dangerous path. If we execute an innocent person now, the wolf wins. Let us be rational: who truly benefits from this chaos?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, the one who benefits is the one who can manipulate the remaining players into a mistake. Your plea for rationality is a classic shield. Between Rin's chaos and your calculated silence, the latter is far more dangerous. I'm voting for you.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
